  {
    
    "name": "Section 2",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-623665931356210132 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=623665894848987894&sectionId=623665931356210132)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggk1pM8Q6PO_text","label":"ggk1pM8Q6PO_text","default":"Top Longevity Doctors: \"This Is the Fastest Way to Reverse Biological Age - And It's Coming Out of Shanghai\""},{"type":"html","id":"ggQ72b5RsRg_text","label":"ggQ72b5RsRg_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(26,26,26);\">May 20th, 2026 | 9:14 AM EST</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglwH2hwsal_text","label":"gglwH2hwsal_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(26,26,26);\">Written by Dr. Marcus Hale, MD | Longevity Medicine &amp; Translational Biology (26 years)</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwXq-yaokN_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggwXq-yaokN_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/dr-marcus-hale.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwXq-yaokN_alt","label":"ggwXq-yaokN_alt","default":"Describes the appearance of the image"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1eT2Uc1md_text","label":"gg1eT2Uc1md_text","default":"<p><strong>Dr. Marcus Hale, MD</strong></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(101,103,107)!important;\"><strong>Longevity Medicine &amp; Translational Biology (26 years)</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDh6t0eibL_text","label":"ggDh6t0eibL_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(245,166,35)!important;\"><strong>★★★★★ </strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:#0C0C0C;\"><strong>4.8/5</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(101,103,107)!important;\"><strong> - 11,400+ verified customers</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvtW4GIgjx_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggvtW4GIgjx_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-02.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggazex4vYN1_text","label":"ggazex4vYN1_text","default":"<p>Dear Friend Worried About Aging,&nbsp; If you're reading this with that quiet, creeping suspicion that something has shifted in your body over the last few years - the stiffness when you stand up, the afternoon fog that didn't used to be there, the face in the mirror that looks like it's settling in instead of still building - I want you to stop scrolling for a moment.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I almost didn't write this letter.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As a longevity doctor with twenty-six years in translational biology, I am careful about what I put my name to.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But what I have watched happen in my own clinic over the last fourteen months, in the bloodwork of patients I have personally followed back from Shanghai, is something I cannot in good conscience keep quiet about.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So I'm going to tell you what I saw, what it means, and exactly what to do with this information - if you have the courage to actually act on it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggozxRB27Hy_text","label":"ggozxRB27Hy_text","default":"THE PHONE CALL THAT CHANGED EVERYTHING I THOUGHT I KNEW ABOUT AGING…"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCUbVmTRcb_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggCUbVmTRcb_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-03.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTWzlUMYsJ_text","label":"ggTWzlUMYsJ_text","default":"<p>It happened on a Tuesday afternoon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I had just finished rounds when my phone rang.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It was James Calloway - a longtime patient, sixty-four years old, retired managing partner of one of the largest private equity firms in the Northeast.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>James is the kind of man who plays squash four mornings a week, reads three medical journals for fun, and has never once missed his annual executive physical.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>He is also the kind of man who does not call his doctor in the middle of the day unless something is wrong.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"Marcus,\" he said, \"I need you to look at my numbers.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I just got back from Shanghai.\" I almost laughed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"James, why on Earth were you in Shanghai?\" \"Because,\" he said, \"two of my partners have been going for the last eight months.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And Marcus - they don't look the same anymore.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'm not talking about a tan.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'm talking about the way their skin sits on their face.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The way they get out of a chair.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Last weekend I watched Bill - he's sixty-eight - beat his thirty-five-year-old son in straight sets.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have known Bill for twenty-two years.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The man couldn't climb a flight of stairs without complaining about his knee last year.\" That was the call.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A week later, James was sitting in my office sliding a manila envelope across my desk.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Inside was a TruDiagnostic epigenetic panel - baseline, and again ninety days later.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>His biological age had dropped from <strong>71.2 to 34.6.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thirty-six and a half years.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In ninety days.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have been doing this for a long time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have never seen numbers move like that.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I picked up the phone and started making my own calls.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9D6unGw81_text","label":"gg9D6unGw81_text","default":"WHY THE WEALTHIEST PEOPLE ON EARTH ARE QUIETLY FLYING TO SHANGHAI"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDr27byezm_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggDr27byezm_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-05.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGyJEdQZhx_text","label":"ggGyJEdQZhx_text","default":"<p>For five months I became a man possessed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I cancelled speaking engagements.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I read every available paper out of the Shanghai Institute of Biochemistry and Cell Biology, the Shanghai Institute of Materia Medica, and the longevity divisions attached to Fudan and ShanghaiTech Universities.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I personally reviewed labs, bloodwork, epigenetic clocks, inflammatory panels, and cardiac scans from seventeen patients who had gone through the Shanghai protocol.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The pattern was no longer deniable.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Chinese government has poured a staggering amount of capital into translational longevity science over the last fifteen years, and unlike in the United States, where the field is fragmented across hundreds of competing private startups, Shanghai's major research institutions operate in coordinated clusters.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They share data.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They share results.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They run human trials at a speed that is simply not possible under the current FDA framework.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Bryan Johnson - the man spending two million dollars a year on his Blueprint protocol — has publicly admitted the most advanced peptide work on Earth is being done in Shanghai.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Peter Attia has referenced it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So has David Sinclair.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They just don't say it on television.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why people who can afford a sixteen-hour flight on a private jet are taking it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And what they figured out - the genuinely important part - is that aging is not one process.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It is at least twelve distinct biological processes happening at the same time, falling into three categories that must be addressed <strong>simultaneously, in sequence, with three different classes of compounds.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6BqQxba9d_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg6BqQxba9d_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/3_layer_32a93ee8-2f00-42c2-9137-87222ecc8537.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6Y8HKx4KW_text","label":"gg6Y8HKx4KW_text","default":"<p>Think of your body as a precision machine that has been running on three failing systems at once.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>By age forty, your <strong>mitochondria</strong> - the energy factories inside every cell - start piling up damaged units faster than your body can recycle them.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The process that clears them out, called mitophagy, slows to a crawl.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Energy drops.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Inflammation rises.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Recovery takes weeks instead of days.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>By 50, your <strong>NAD+</strong> levels - the molecular fuel that powers more than five hundred enzymatic reactions, including every single DNA-repair pathway you have - are roughly half what they were at twenty.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your sirtuins (the so-called longevity genes) literally cannot function without NAD+.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The repair crews are still on payroll.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They just have nothing left to work with.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>By 60, your <strong>peptide signaling</strong> - the precise messengers that tell your tissues to repair, rebuild, and stay structurally strong - has collapsed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sleep architecture falls apart.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Collagen synthesis crawls.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Wounds that healed in three days at thirty now take three weeks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The body forgets how to be young.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The longevity research community has known this since the 2013 Lopez-Otin paper The Hallmarks of Aging - the single most-cited paper in the field.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Every supplement, drug, and protocol marketed to aging Americans over the last thirty years has tried to target <strong>one</strong> of these hallmarks at a time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>NAD+ boosters.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Resveratrol.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Senolytics.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Each one good at one thing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>None of them addressing the full picture.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Shanghai clusters figured out that you have to hit all three layers - mitochondrial cleanup, NAD+ restoration, peptide signaling - at the same time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is the discovery.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8oPYq92jl_text","label":"gg8oPYq92jl_text","default":"WHY EVERYTHING YOU'VE TRIED HAS QUIETLY FAILED&nbsp;"},{"type":"html","id":"ggA4qT-g2cQ_text","label":"ggA4qT-g2cQ_text","default":"<p>I have prescribed and reviewed every major longevity intervention available in the United States for the last decade.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Let me dismantle the single-compound options you have probably tried — and explain why none of them, on their own, has ever moved the needle for you the way the field promised they would.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>NMN alone.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Yes, it raises NAD+.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But taken without a methyl donor like TMG, it slowly depletes your methylation pathway, drives up homocysteine, and quietly costs you elsewhere.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Most NMN brands on Amazon are also under-dosed by 60-70%.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Resveratrol.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Sinclair-era darling.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Almost no clinically meaningful effect in humans without active sirtuin substrate (NAD+).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It is the spark with no fuel — sold by the millions of bottles to people who never get the second compound.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Standard testosterone replacement.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Expensive — $200–400/month — and it addresses exactly one hormone while doing nothing for the underlying mitochondrial, NAD+, and peptide-signaling collapse driving the symptoms in the first place.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Concierge longevity clinics.</strong> $30,000 to $100,000 per year.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Marble lobbies, extensive labs, identical underlying protocol.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The science they are delivering is real.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The markup is the building you are sitting in.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>\"Anti-aging\" supplements off Amazon.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Astragalus.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Spermidine.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Berberine.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Most are under-dosed by an order of magnitude.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>None of them address all three layers of the aging process.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You are paying for the label, not the compound.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Every one of these treats a single mechanism while ignoring the other two layers that are still failing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why nothing has worked.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why your blood markers have not moved.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why the mirror keeps telling the same story.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvAlc-ENwp_text","label":"ggvAlc-ENwp_text","default":"THE 3-COMPOUND PROTOCOL HIDING IN PLAIN SIGHT"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfRX_smaMq_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggfRX_smaMq_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-07_11deebcc-a4a2-4170-817e-997e4ee7f40f.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWpneNwPrV_text","label":"ggWpneNwPrV_text","default":"<p>Remember James?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Six weeks after I put him on the full three-layer Shanghai protocol, his wife noticed before he did.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>She told him at breakfast that the texture of his skin had changed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>He looked in the mirror three times before he saw it himself.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Day ninety: biological age 34.6.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>CRP 0.8.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>VO2 max 41.2.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Resting heart rate 58.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>His cardiologist - a colleague of mine at Mass General - called me directly and asked me to put his wife on it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The protocol is three compounds.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Each one targets a different one of the three aging layers.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Each one is dosed at the exact level the clinical literature actually demands.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And each one is useless without the other two.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggy_LEi-h-j_text","label":"ggy_LEi-h-j_text","default":"1. AgeAura Pure Urolithin A - the Mitophagy Activator."},{"type":"html","id":"ggktXWJoQHn_text","label":"ggktXWJoQHn_text","default":"<p>The only compound ever proven in a Nature Metabolism human trial to directly activate mitochondrial recycling.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Cleans damaged mitochondria out of your cells the way your body did at thirty. <strong>500 mg clinical</strong> <strong>dose</strong> - not the 100-250 mg cosmetic doses you see on Amazon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is Layer 1: you cannot rebuild a cell that has not first been cleaned.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPL5wbFxAr_text","label":"ggPL5wbFxAr_text","default":"2. AgeAura Pure NMN + TMG - the NAD+ Restoration Pair."},{"type":"html","id":"gg3sLyvdeG7_text","label":"gg3sLyvdeG7_text","default":"<p>Clinical-dose NMN pre-paired with trimethylglycine - the methyl donor that lets NMN raise NAD+ without taxing your methylation pathway elsewhere.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Take NMN alone and you are running a hidden tax.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Take them together, the way Shanghai does, and you raise NAD+ cleanly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is Layer 2: the fuel for every repair you have left.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOGV6-TpTE_text","label":"ggOGV6-TpTE_text","default":"3. AgeAura Pure Longevity Peptides - the Signaling Layer."},{"type":"html","id":"ggLKnF_OxwX_text","label":"ggLKnF_OxwX_text","default":"<p>A pharmaceutical-grade peptide complex sourced from the same manufacturer that supplies several Shanghai clinical programs.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Tells your body, at the molecular level, to start behaving the way it did fifteen years ago.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sleep deepens.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Recovery accelerates.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Skin elasticity returns.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Lean tissue rebuilds.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Miss even one layer and you stay stuck.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why every single-compound product on the market has failed you.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why the full protocol works.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKExGY7UWi_text","label":"ggKExGY7UWi_text","default":"WORD SPREAD INSIDE THE FIELD"},{"type":"html","id":"ggW54_5hbR3_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggW54_5hbR3_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-08.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmjHR0lVRP_text","label":"ggmjHR0lVRP_text","default":"<p>After James's panel came back, word got out the way it always does in a tight medical circle.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Slowly at first.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Then quickly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Two cardiologists at Mass General asked me about it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A peptide-therapy MD in New York flew up to review the data.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>By month four I had patients flying in from Los Angeles, Miami, and Vancouver.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>By month eight I was tracking roughly fourteen hundred patients on the same three-layer protocol, every one of them showing measurable biological-age reduction in their first ninety days.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4Y6vnsthP_text","label":"gg4Y6vnsthP_text","default":"AND THEN THE PUSHBACK STARTED"},{"type":"html","id":"ggM8sxwElkN_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggM8sxwElkN_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/protocol_877d5c69-28fe-4611-8ce3-f5a1b7792dae.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1ZYkq7Z-X_text","label":"gg1ZYkq7Z-X_text","default":"<p>First it was friendly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A colleague I have known for eighteen years pulled me aside at a longevity-medicine conference and told me, kindly, that what I was describing was \"going to make a lot of people uncomfortable.\" Then it was less friendly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A polite letter from a supplement industry trade association suggesting I \"reconsider how I framed my findings publicly.\" Then a regulatory body opened an inquiry - no findings, just an inquiry, that took six months to resolve.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The reason is obvious.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>American supplement companies make their money selling you one compound at a time, at the lowest possible dose that can legally carry the name on the label.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>American pharmaceutical companies cannot patent NMN.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They cannot patent Urolithin A.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They cannot patent naturally occurring peptide sequences.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There is nobody with a stock price who is incentivized to put this on the news.</p><p>Addresses the ROOT CAUSE of biological aging (all three layers - not one at a time)</p><p>Costs less than one month at any concierge longevity clinic</p><p>Delivered to your door - no $200,000 Swiss retreat, no clinic membership fee</p><p>But here is what the trade associations didn't count on… the patients getting their lives back weren't going to stay quiet.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They told their spouses.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They told their friends.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They told their cardiologists.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The information was moving faster than anyone could shut it down.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx4Ub_3LKV_text","label":"ggx4Ub_3LKV_text","default":"THE ONLY PROTOCOL THAT DELIVERS ALL THREE LAYERS"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNj5z5WJER_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggNj5z5WJER_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-10_f0a3c8df-4fa5-48a2-b447-453f192b9caf.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggl9xCMbVd__text","label":"ggl9xCMbVd__text","default":"<p>It is called the <strong>AgeAura Pure Protocol.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Three pharmaceutical-grade compounds.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>One daily ritual.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Clinical doses on every single ingredient.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Manufactured to the same specifications as the Shanghai-affiliated clinical programs.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Available without the flight.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTt-JdzZXn_text","label":"ggTt-JdzZXn_text","default":"HERE'S EXACTLY WHAT HAPPENS INSIDE YOUR BODY"},{"type":"html","id":"ggR4qXI5cZp_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggR4qXI5cZp_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-11.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9xoXv2Izn_text","label":"gg9xoXv2Izn_text","default":"<p><strong>Days 1–7: The Mitophagy Awakening.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Urolithin A activates the cellular recycling pathway that has been dormant since your forties.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Damaged mitochondria start clearing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The first thing most patients report — including James — is that the afternoon energy crash simply does not happen anymore.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Deep sleep, measured on an Oura ring, climbs 12–18% within the first week. <strong>Days 8–28: The NAD+ Surge.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>NMN + TMG drives tissue NAD+ levels back up toward where they were in your thirties.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Mental clarity sharpens.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Inflammatory markers (CRP) typically drop by 50–60%.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Patients report being able to read at ten p.m.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"the way they could in their forties.\" Resting heart rate falls 8–12 beats. <strong>Days 29–60: The Peptide Rebuild.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Longevity Peptide complex takes over.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Visible change.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Skin texture shifts.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Jawline tightens.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Lean tissue gains begin, fat loss begins - without changing training or diet.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Spouses notice before patients do. <strong>Days 61–90: The Biological Age Drop.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The full ninety-day panel - TruDiagnostic epigenetic clock, full inflammatory panel, VO2 max, sleep architecture - comes back showing measured biological age reduction of 12 to 36 years against baseline.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is not exaggeration.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is the average across roughly fourteen hundred patients I am now personally tracking.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdKaUkKuAa_text","label":"ggdKaUkKuAa_text","default":"THE RESULTS SPEAK FOR THEMSELVES"},{"type":"html","id":"gg48ZbcKpd0_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg48ZbcKpd0_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-12.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggf-rpOltkt_text","label":"ggf-rpOltkt_text","default":"<p>In the last fourteen months, more than 11,400 men and women have started the AgeAura Pure Protocol. <strong>92% report measurable energy, sleep, and recovery improvements within the first thirty days</strong>. 78% show a biological age reduction of more than ten years on a ninety-day TruDiagnostic panel.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Average CRP reduction across the cohort: 64%.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Average sleep efficiency gain: 19 percentage points.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But my favorite numbers are the stories that come in every single day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Dr. Richard K., Internal Medicine, 19 years in practice.</strong> \"I do not endorse supplement protocols lightly. The AgeAura stack is the only one I have ever personally taken, recommended to my own mother, and put on my own intake form. The biomarker data is the most consistent thing I have seen in nineteen years.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Michael T., 54, Senior Project Manager.</strong> \"Three months ago I could not hike with my son without my knees flaring. Last weekend we summited a 9,000-foot peak and I did not take a single ibuprofen. My cardiologist asked what I was doing. I told him. He asked me to send him the link.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglngwj4pyo_text","label":"gglngwj4pyo_text","default":"THE PRICE THAT MAKES CONCIERGE CLINICS UNCOMFORTABLE"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZQX9REEXO_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggZQX9REEXO_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/ageaura-f6-13.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpfYzVSQPw_text","label":"ggpfYzVSQPw_text","default":"<p>Let me show you what \"managing\" aging actually costs in America: The Concierge Clinic Route</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbfq2nVpjK_childItem_0","label":"ggbfq2nVpjK_childItem_0","default":"<p>Fountain Life membership: $30,000 – $100,000 / year&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbfq2nVpjK_childItem_1","label":"ggbfq2nVpjK_childItem_1","default":"<p>Annual lab panels &amp; physician oversight: $4,000 – $8,000&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbfq2nVpjK_childItem_2","label":"ggbfq2nVpjK_childItem_2","default":"<p>Annual cost: $34,000 – $108,000/year - for the same underlying compound stack with a marble lobby attached.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggas4yIE7e3_text","label":"ggas4yIE7e3_text","default":"<p>The Bryan Johnson Blueprint Route</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglcBd-aRP1_childItem_0","label":"gglcBd-aRP1_childItem_0","default":"<p>Self-experiment protocol cost: ~$2,000,000 / year</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglcBd-aRP1_childItem_1","label":"gglcBd-aRP1_childItem_1","default":"<p>Personal team, chefs, sleep specialists, equipment: included in the above</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglcBd-aRP1_childItem_2","label":"gglcBd-aRP1_childItem_2","default":"<p>Annual cost: $2,000,000, and Bryan himself has publicly admitted the most advanced peptide work is being done in Shanghai, not in his Venice Beach lab.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguZ94saKz0_text","label":"gguZ94saKz0_text","default":"<p>The Private Swiss Longevity Clinic Route</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguZXVYcjy3_childItem_0","label":"gguZXVYcjy3_childItem_0","default":"<p>One-week intake at a top-tier Swiss clinic: €150,000 – €400,000</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguZXVYcjy3_childItem_1","label":"gguZXVYcjy3_childItem_1","default":"<p>Travel, accommodation, ongoing maintenance: additional</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguZXVYcjy3_childItem_2","label":"gguZXVYcjy3_childItem_2","default":"<p>And the protocol they put you on is, in most cases, sourced from the same Shanghai pharmaceutical-grade manufacturer that supplies us.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZ51QZVjAx_text","label":"ggZ51QZVjAx_text","default":"<p>The longevity-clinic industry LOVES these structures.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Know why?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because you keep coming back.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Annual membership.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Quarterly bloodwork at $1,200 a panel.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"Maintenance phase\" billing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The incentive is for you to stay in the program, not to get better.</p><p>I built the AgeAura Pure Protocol because I watched my own father lose his last ten years to a series of compounding small declines that were each, in isolation, treatable — and together, fatal.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because my patients deserve access to the same Shanghai-grade three-layer protocol the wealthiest people on Earth are already running, without the flight.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because every year a person spends on single-compound supplements is a year they will not get back.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because someone had to do this and nobody else was going to.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggP5EIbFShu_text","label":"ggP5EIbFShu_text","default":"THE INTRODUCTORY PRICE THAT BREAKS THE CONCIERGE MODEL"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8E-MszmLH_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg8E-MszmLH_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/04._AAR_old_man_holding_products_81c9e7bc-3530-4ce5-bca3-454f1945ab7a.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQluG8Rzkw_text","label":"ggQluG8Rzkw_text","default":"<p>Remember those trade-association letters I mentioned?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The \"please reconsider your framing\" ones?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here is exactly what they are worried about.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The same three-compound protocol — full clinical dose on every layer — that the most expensive longevity clinics on Earth are quietly running on their highest-paying clients, available directly to your door at a fraction of one percent of the clinic cost.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>No marble lobby.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>No \"membership fee.\" No annual retainer.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Just the protocol.</p><p>For the ONLY protocol that addresses all three root layers of biological aging.</p><p>Why would I price it this way?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcv4D51bTY_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggcv4D51bTY_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/05._AAR_side_by_side_8da60d90-3aa3-4bb2-b863-266c29e794f9.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggzPsYUmks2_text","label":"ggzPsYUmks2_text","default":"<p>Because every patient who reverses their biological age is another data point that makes the concierge-clinic markup harder to defend.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because I want the protocol in the hands of people who could never afford a Swiss retreat, not just the people who can.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because the science is bigger than the business model around it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggc9YfnS1lQ_label","label":"ggc9YfnS1lQ_label","default":"<p>Check Availability Now&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggepwZP0Hba_text","label":"ggepwZP0Hba_text","default":"MY PERSONAL 90-DAY \"GIVE ME BACK THE DECADE\" GUARANTEE"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoQO7xXFDV_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggoQO7xXFDV_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/3933de21-7e33-409a-b3a9-58a4443315d0_a7c6e167-4340-4427-bcf5-0bc02ae9ac77.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-AQUUPmIu_text","label":"gg-AQUUPmIu_text","default":"<p>Look, I understand.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You have been burned before.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Spent money on \"breakthrough\" longevity products that did nothing measurable.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Read every Reddit thread on NMN and walked away unsure.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I am going to make this as simple as I possibly can.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Run the full three-layer AgeAura Pure Protocol for 90 days.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If, at the end of those 90 days, you do not see the energy, sleep, recovery, and clarity shifts I have described in this letter — or if your bloodwork does not move — you write to my team.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We refund you in full.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>No interrogation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>No retention script.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>No catch.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I can offer this guarantee because, in practice, our return rate runs under 2%.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLLN4KPcQm_label","label":"ggLLN4KPcQm_label","default":"<p>Check Availability Now&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1PLJBeCLv_text","label":"gg1PLJBeCLv_text","default":"BUT HERE'S THE CATCH (AND IT'S A REAL ONE)"},{"type":"html","id":"gguVo647Scn_text","label":"gguVo647Scn_text","default":"<p>Stock alert: only 1,847 protocol bundles remaining at this introductory price.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Not because I am playing scarcity games.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because the peptide layer in particular is produced in small, pharmaceutical-grade batches and the next batch will be priced at the higher tier that reflects the actual current cost of peptide synthesis.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We have absorbed that cost for one final window.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>After this one, we cannot.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8XxY45a7L_childItem_0","label":"gg8XxY45a7L_childItem_0","default":"<p>Funding the concierge-clinic model.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8XxY45a7L_childItem_1","label":"gg8XxY45a7L_childItem_1","default":"<p>Subsidizing the supplement industry's single-compound margins.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8XxY45a7L_childItem_2","label":"gg8XxY45a7L_childItem_2","default":"<p>Watching another decade quietly disappear.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeB7HxDJ5J_text","label":"ggeB7HxDJ5J_text","default":"<p>While the actual protocol is sitting right here, at less than a single Swiss clinic intake call.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3LdCrsRwi_label","label":"gg3LdCrsRwi_label","default":"<p>Check Availability Now&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3bgK4J8d__text","label":"gg3bgK4J8d__text","default":"THE CHOICE THAT DEFINES YOUR NEXT DECADE"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCzOGqJ640_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggCzOGqJ640_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/07._Ltc_AAR_SecA_Catherine_F._56_ece1a2c6-ecaf-44d0-9c76-91ced1cd21c1.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnvXL1eFo9_text","label":"ggnvXL1eFo9_text","default":"<p>Right now, you are at a crossroads. <strong>Path #1: Keep Doing What You're Doing</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Keep stacking single-compound supplements.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Keep wondering why your bloodwork is not moving.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Keep watching the mirror tell the same story.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Wake up a year from now stiffer.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Wake up five years from now in a difficult conversation with your cardiologist.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Wake up ten years from now looking at the people who started in their fifties with a quiet, private regret that has no name. <strong>Path #2: Start the Three-Layer Protocol.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Mitophagy + NAD+ + peptide signaling, addressed together, in sequence, every day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sleep differently in four weeks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Move differently in twelve.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Look differently in six months.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Be looked at differently in a year.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The numbers are real.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The cohort is real.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The path is real.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You only get to choose once.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLyP1kzePU_text","label":"ggLyP1kzePU_text","default":"HERE'S EXACTLY WHAT TO DO NEXT"},{"type":"html","id":"ggr1bqyz81t_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggr1bqyz81t_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/0._Ltc_AAR_hero_image_45bf906a-cb64-4731-80d4-f5cd1fd2fe52.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcvxJXV3b1_text","label":"ggcvxJXV3b1_text","default":"<p>1. Click the button below that says <strong>\"Start My AgeAura Protocol\".</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2. Choose your bundle tier (single month, Buy 2 Get 1, Buy 3 Get 2, or the full year Practitioner tier).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>3. Enter your shipping (delivered in 48 hours from our North American fulfillment partner).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>4. Start Layer 1 (Urolithin A) on Day 1 — Layers 2 and 3 stack in from Day 4.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>5. Track sleep, energy, and recovery for the first 30 days.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>6. At Day 90, pull a TruDiagnostic panel and compare it to your baseline.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is the entire process.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Four bottles, three layers, ninety days, one new decade.</p><p>But whatever you do, do not close this page thinking \"I'll order later.\" Later doesn't exist when your biological clock is the one running out.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The 1,847-bundle window will close.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The next batch will be priced higher.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Six months from now you will be six months further into a decline that is reversing itself for the people who decided today.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLUdJahV3U_label","label":"ggLUdJahV3U_label","default":"<p>Check Availability Now&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsMgMkSoOf_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggsMgMkSoOf_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/06._AAR_bundle_image_d9370665-5cd8-40e6-807d-5225b873287d.webp"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNMASXq_zb_text","label":"ggNMASXq_zb_text","default":"<p><a href=\"https://wellnessnest.co/pages/ageaura-pure-protocol\"><strong><u>GET AGEAURA INTRODUCTORY PRICE NOW!</u></strong></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXzjCFsY0__text","label":"ggXzjCFsY0__text","default":"<p>Your cells have waited long enough. Click below and let's start the reversal.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9FYyGNI15_label","label":"gg9FYyGNI15_label","default":